fixture death_far_from_the_spawn
doc Presentation review r3, M2: Ash (1 heart) walks from the spawn (x 100) to a red-swinging dummy at x 700 and is killed by its swing, then sent back to the spawn on that tick; the drawn player cuts there, never slides across the room (test_views).
room test/dummy_red_far
option hearts 1
frames 140
input
  0..61 R
end
expect
  at 130 hearts=1 x=649u
  at 131 event.player_hit=1 event.death=1 hearts=5 x=100u
end
